# Crossing: a 1x3-cell bridge that lets a perpendicular cable pass UNDER its raised middle cell.
# ONE prefab serves the three per-medium crossing types (CrossingPower/Pipe/Conveyor): the gray
# authored here is replaced by the type's medium hue in StructureSystem::applyStructureTint, and
# the crossing conducts ONLY its own medium between its two END cells (rebuildDerivedLinks).
# Oriented at placement (entity -Z = the long axis); the
# collider is a low 3-cell box in LOCAL space, rotated with the entity. Walk-through like cables
# (Layer Cable, collides only with Projectile). Spawned origin 0.25 above ground.
Prefab gameCrossing
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node CubeHalf
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.7 0.7 0.75
		Position 0 0.55 0
		Scale 0.5
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Layer Cable
		CollidesWith Projectile
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 0.25 3
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name EndA
			Position 0 0 -2
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeHalf
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.7 0.7 0.75
				Scale 0.5
		Entity
			Name EndB
			Position 0 0 2
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeHalf
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.7 0.7 0.75
				Scale 0.5
		Entity
			Name RampA
			Position 0 0.3 -1
			Rotation -35 0 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Cylinder2
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.7 0.7 0.75
				Scale 0.35
		Entity
			Name RampB
			Position 0 0.3 1
			Rotation 35 0 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Cylinder2
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.7 0.7 0.75
				Scale 0.35
